cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt these slides, please cite them as below."
title: "INFO 521: Machine Learning Foundations — Lecture Slides"
abstract: >-
  Quarto and reveal.js lecture decks for INFO 521, Machine Learning
  Foundations, at the University of Arizona College of Information Science.
  Seven modules covering least squares and maximum likelihood, probability
  and estimation, Monte Carlo methods, exact and conjugate Bayesian
  inference, approximate Bayesian inference, classification, and
  unsupervised methods, plus a per-module overview deck, recording scripts,
  and student note pages. Rendered output is committed and served as a
  static site. Companion repository to the INFO 521 course hub.
